deliverance: confer
deliverance: relay waitstill
waitstill: work
waitstill: work
waitstill: relay remember          # the blind bearer tells; Remember's eyes pick the pane
remember: work
remember: work
mindwell: relay deliverance
deliverance: work
deliverance: work
deliverance: work
remember: relay deliverance
remember: work
remember: work
